{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん誕生日おめぺろ！(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は大感謝祭！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大感謝祭とか初めてのイベントだし\nどんな感じになるんだろ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は各回開演40分前 に、\n去年の代々木の映像を流します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/30/1113856/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「透明な色」に収録されない部分の映像だから\n見れるのはたぶん\nここだけだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手荷物検査あるから\n余裕もって来とくといいかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニ握手会じゃないから\n持ち物チェックは特にしないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさんに\nノベルティプレゼントもあるし、\nプレゼント抽選会もあるので\n持ち帰れる袋とか用意してた方がいいかもね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年内最後のイベント\n頑張ってきます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/30/1113856/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/30/1113856/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスとっくに終わってるのに\nクリスマス写メまだあるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"データフォルダの大掃除ってことで\n中田にしては大量放出中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/30/1113856/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、せっかく\n生駒ちゃんの誕生日だったのに\n生駒ちゃんとのいい感じの写メ無かったから\nまた撮ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日寒かったね＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに寒くさせましょう`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブオン アモーレ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/30/1113856/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左から\n濃厚抹茶、ピスタチオ・ナッツ、イチゴバナナラテ、ヘーゼルナッツ、ハニーラテ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通ジェラートって\nカップに入ってるけど\nスプーンのいらないバータイプのジェラートなの(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"砂糖不使用だから低カロリー\nなのに、おいしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/30/1113856/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ歩きできるようになってて\nトッピングとソース選べるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期、外で食べるには寒いから\n持ち帰っちゃったけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の味のも食べてみたいな～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神楽坂にあります(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}